## Verification Commands

<!-- The project's native commands, for running checks directly. EDF skills call the
     plugin's wrapper scripts themselves, so don't list those here: ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}
     expands only in skills and hooks, not in CLAUDE.md or the Bash environment. -->

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `<e.g. npx vitest run [file] / uv run pytest [file]>` | Unit tests |
| `<e.g. npx tsc --noEmit / uv run mypy .>` | Type check |
| `<e.g. npx eslint . / uv run ruff check>` | Lint |
| `<e.g. npm run build>` | Build |
| `<e.g. npx markdownlint-cli2 "**/*.md">` | Markdown lint |

