## Knowledge Base (kb/)

EDF skills read these directly: `kb/architecture.md` (layer rules, reusable helpers),
`kb/anti-patterns.md` (corrected mistakes), `kb/conventions.md` (naming, test paths),
`kb/file-map.md` (concept → path). Read them before designing or reviewing; run
`/edf:setup` to scaffold them.
